        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Point.  Heavy white cotton; three bands of drawn-work, in the two outer ones the pattern is woven in with a needle and orange thread.  The wide border with a design of squares and diamonds , is worked with orange, bright green and dark red cotton.  A heavy white bobbin lace is sewed to one edge."@en ;
